WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.883
Practical AI for Everyday Work.

00:00:01.883 --> 00:00:06.865
A good prompt describes the intended reader, the
task, the inputs, and the output.

00:00:06.865 --> 00:00:09.417
Suppose a colleague needs a status update.

00:00:09.417 --> 00:00:14.460
Give the model three verified bullets and ask
for an email under one hundred words.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.680
Tell it to mark any missing date instead of
guessing.
